    "---\n",
    "title: \"Transformer Architecture\"\n",
    "subtitle: \"Encoders\"\n",
    "author: \"Miguel Fonseca\"\n",
    "format:\n",
    "  revealjs:\n",
    "    toc: true\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Motivation\n",
    "\n",
    "We want to learn representations of sequential data that:\n",
    "\n",
    "- capture **long-range dependencies**\n",
    "- integrate **multiple signals simultaneously**\n",
    "- adapt to **context dynamically**\n",
    "\n",
    "Challenges:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Financial time series are noisy and non-stationary  \n",
    "- NLP data is highly context-dependent  \n",
    "- Classical models struggle to combine **global context + multiple features**\n",
    "\n",
    "Transformer encoders provide a unified solution:\n",
    "\n",
    "- global context via attention  \n",
    "- flexible representation learning  \n",
    "- scalable training  \n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Encoder Role\n",
    "\n",
    "Input:\n",
    "$$\n",
    "(x_1, \\dots, x_T)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Output:\n",
    "$$\n",
    "(h_1, \\dots, h_T)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Each representation is **contextual**\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Encoder Block\n",
    "\n",
    "Pipeline:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Multi-head attention  \n",
    "- Add & Norm  \n",
    "- Feedforward  \n",
    "- Add & Norm  \n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Feedforward Layer\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{FFN}(\\mathbf x)=\\text{ReLU}(\\mathbf x \\mathbf W_1+\\mathbf b_1)\\mathbf W_2+\\mathbf b_2\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "- Same network applied per token  \n",
    "- Learns nonlinear features  \n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Residual + Normalization\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\mathbf x + \\text{sublayer}(\\mathbf x)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "**Effect:**\n",
    "\n",
    "- stabilizes training  \n",
    "- enables deep stacking\n",
    "- normalizes across features\n",
    "\n",
    "> Especially important for deep transformers\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Representation Learning\n",
    "\n",
    "**What does the encoder learn?**\n",
    "\n",
    "Each token representation:\n",
    "\n",
    "- context-aware\n",
    "- task-adaptive\n",
    "\n",
    "Example:\n",
    "\n",
    ">“bank” → river vs finance (context-dependent)\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Pooling Strategies\n",
    "\n",
    "To get a single vector:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **CLS token** (BERT-style)\n",
    "- **Mean pooling**\n",
    "- **Max pooling**\n",
    "\n",
    ">Choice affects downstream performance\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## TensorFlow 2: Encoder Block"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
